#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:308
#: ae74ec8f824348809564937c008ba68f
msgid "A few key features of the XML file are:"
msgstr "XML 文件的几个关键特性如下："

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:310
#: 621f7983e27540768a8e4a315eb5b804
msgid "you can have as many graphs as you like in a single XML file"
msgstr "在单个 XML 文件中可以包含任意数量的图表"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:311
#: 9d9a8e9bb2a946bf91e5095c07353291
msgid "Each graph has a name which should be unique"
msgstr "每个图表都有一个应唯一的名称"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:312
#: 4c48b3891eaf4271abbed585b4e74daf
msgid ""
"The '/' separators in the name determine where the graph appears in the menu"
" structure"
msgstr "名称中的「/」分隔符决定图表在菜单结构中的显示位置"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:314
#: 54309ea78f134668b98408e86321882b
msgid "Each graph should have a text description"
msgstr "每个图表应有一段文本描述"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:315
#: 27298977b8c8467dac499ec00ee227d8
msgid ""
"Each graph can have multiple expression. The first expression that is "
"applicable to the current log is used in producing the graph."
msgstr "每个图表可以有多个表达式。第一个适用于当前日志的表达式将用于生成图表。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:318
#: 8232cdc81a884bafbfd63a59ab48e036
msgid ""
"because there are multiple expressions for a graph you can create one graph "
"definition that works for both telemetry logs and dataflash logs, and works "
"for copter, plane and rover. It also allows us to add new expressions to "
"cope with changing field names as ArduPilot evolves."
msgstr ""
"由于一个图表有多个表达式，您可以创建一个图表定义，使其同时适用于数传日志和 dataflash 日志，以及适用于 copter、plane 和 "
"rover。这也允许我们添加新表达式，以应对 ArduPilot 演进过程中字段名称的变化。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:324
#: b5a6b8cea4cd47c39fbb32841821fc69
msgid "Reloading the graphs"
msgstr "重新加载图表"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:326
#: 03f0e7d9d04243f7a9119c4f34dfdd12
msgid ""
"When editing XML files to add graphs you don't need to exit and restart "
"MAVExplorer to try out your new graphs. Just run the command \"reload\" or "
"use the \"Reload Graphs\" menu item and your new graphs will be loaded into "
"the menus."
msgstr ""
"编辑 XML 文件以添加图表时，无需退出并重启 MAVExplorer 来尝试新图表。只需运行「reload」命令或使用「Reload "
"Graphs」菜单项，您的新图表即会加载到菜单中。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:332
#: 16b13c903012487586b5dd18ae34275b
msgid "Contributing Graphs"
msgstr "贡献图表"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:334
#: 1a40630358db420298bf49f8431cf615
msgid ""
"One of the main reasons for the XML files in MAVExplorer is to allow "
"community members to contribute new graphs that are useful in log analysis. "
"If you create a set of useful graphs please send them by email to andrew-"
"mavexplorer@tridgell.net or open a pull request against the `MAVProxy git "
"repository <https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`__."
msgstr ""
"MAVExplorer 中 XML 文件的主要原因之一是允许社区成员贡献对日志分析有用的新图表。如果您创建了一组有用的图表，请通过电子邮件发送至 "
"andrew-mavexplorer@tridgell.net 或向 `MAVProxy git 仓库 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy>`__ 提交 PR。"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:340
#: bc58dc1b46494ee29038b1d32f9cf5b4
msgid ""
"For a pull request with graphs, please add the graphs to the "
"`MAVProxy/tools/graphs "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/tree/master/MAVProxy/tools/graphs>`__"
" directory"
msgstr ""
"对于包含图表的 PR，请将图表添加到 `MAVProxy/tools/graphs "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/MAVProxy/tree/master/MAVProxy/tools/graphs>`__"
" 目录"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:345
#: 66bf6ae309954874a0b6d37cb21e0c0b
msgid "Useful Commands"
msgstr "常用命令"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:347
#: cdeb8141dd814c20b07c7d37613277e1
msgid ""
"param <regular expression> : displays parameters from log, eg. to show TECS "
"params: \"param TECS_*\" or \"param\" to show all"
msgstr "param <正则表达式>：显示日志中的参数，例如显示 TECS 参数：「param TECS_*」或「param」显示全部"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:348
#: c62b49b264c04113a0d0853d7e210da5
msgid ""
"paramchange <regular expression>: displays changes of parameter(s) "
"throughout the log"
msgstr "paramchange <正则表达式>：显示整个日志中参数的变化"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:349
#: aa5b83155d744acb8f1aa0e409d18971
msgid "messages: displays GCS messages"
msgstr "messages：显示 GCS 消息"

#: ../../source/docs/using-mavexplorer-for-log-analysis.rst:350
#: d2fae4ff0020410298bef36906e7196b
msgid ""
"dump <log message>: dumps all instances of that log message, eg. \"dump "
"IMU\""
msgstr "dump <日志消息>：转储该日志消息的所有实例，例如「dump IMU」"
